1
00:00:00,183 --> 00:00:01,213
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

2
00:00:01,213 --> 00:00:02,253
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

3
00:00:02,253 --> 00:00:03,283
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

4
00:00:06,113 --> 00:00:07,113
(Episode 8)

5
00:00:07,113 --> 00:00:10,783
Can't I be the only man that you are nice to and take care of?

6
00:00:15,283 --> 00:00:17,783
Gosh, this woman really doesn't get it.

7
00:00:20,683 --> 00:00:21,683
Right now,

8
00:00:22,983 --> 00:00:24,283
I'm confessing to you.

9
00:00:24,713 --> 00:00:27,953
Asking you to look at me, and only me.

10
00:00:30,753 --> 00:00:32,653
I'm saying I think I like you, Gyu Rim.

11
00:00:34,283 --> 00:00:35,283
Got it?

12
00:00:35,653 --> 00:00:36,653
If I wanted to be cruel,

13
00:00:36,713 --> 00:00:38,683
I could latch onto you and never let go.

14
00:00:40,683 --> 00:00:41,683
So...

15
00:00:43,253 --> 00:00:44,253
unless you want to get dragged down...

16
00:00:44,253 --> 00:00:45,483
into this mess with me,

17
00:00:46,283 --> 00:00:48,383
you should count your blessings and run away while you can.

18
00:00:50,153 --> 00:00:51,153
No.

19
00:00:53,483 --> 00:00:54,513
I'm not running away.

20
00:00:55,183 --> 00:00:56,613
Whether it's a mess or not,

21
00:00:58,183 --> 00:01:00,453
I'll go anywhere as long as I'm with you, Gyu Rim.

22
00:01:02,153 --> 00:01:03,353
So don't you run away either.

23
00:01:08,613 --> 00:01:09,753
Gyu Rim, could I...

24
00:01:13,853 --> 00:01:15,053
hug you?

25
00:01:23,213 --> 00:01:25,183
Break up? Why would we break up?

26
00:01:25,853 --> 00:01:27,853
That will never happen as long as you don't leave me.

27
00:01:32,613 --> 00:01:33,683
Okay.

28
00:01:35,383 --> 00:01:38,183
I was worried all day that you were going to break up with me.

29
00:01:40,513 --> 00:01:43,283
You didn't answer your phone. You didn't show up for work.

30
00:01:44,253 --> 00:01:45,953
I thought you were sick, so I went to your house,

31
00:01:47,183 --> 00:01:49,283
but Gyu Min said you went to work.

32
00:01:50,983 --> 00:01:52,853
I got so scared that something had really happened to you...

33
00:01:53,053 --> 00:01:54,853
that I was on edge all day.

34
00:01:57,253 --> 00:01:58,283
I'm sorry.

35
00:01:59,183 --> 00:02:01,013
I'm sorry for making you worry.

36
00:02:02,953 --> 00:02:05,013
Do you know how scared I was?

37
00:02:11,313 --> 00:02:12,583
Mu Jin, come on.

38
00:02:16,383 --> 00:02:19,013
Why are you acting like a child? People are watching.

39
00:02:20,253 --> 00:02:21,453
I'm sorry.

40
00:02:40,553 --> 00:02:41,583
Gyu Rim.

41
00:02:42,513 --> 00:02:43,513
Hey.

42
00:02:46,813 --> 00:02:49,613
I saw Mu Jin when I was with Gyu Min.

43
00:02:51,813 --> 00:02:53,453
You told him you were married?

44
00:02:55,853 --> 00:02:58,213
Gyu Seo, I can handle my own problems...

45
00:02:58,213 --> 00:02:59,953
Well, I told him that's not true.

46
00:03:00,553 --> 00:03:03,083
I set the record straight and said you weren't married.

47
00:03:04,883 --> 00:03:07,183
So stop putting up walls, and stop running away.

48
00:03:08,013 --> 00:03:09,983
He still seems to really like you.

49
00:03:11,213 --> 00:03:13,413
If you feel the same way, you should just get back together.

50
00:03:39,753 --> 00:03:40,983
For everything...

51
00:03:43,583 --> 00:03:44,713
I'm so sorry.

52
00:04:05,683 --> 00:04:07,213
I won't bother you again.

53
00:04:28,913 --> 00:04:30,083
As long as we're alive...

54
00:04:34,213 --> 00:04:36,023
Let's never see each other again.

55
00:04:59,613 --> 00:05:01,783
About the offer you made last time.

56
00:05:02,283 --> 00:05:03,383
Is it still valid?

57
00:05:06,253 --> 00:05:09,053
If you are still hiring, I'd like to take the job.

58
00:05:11,153 --> 00:05:12,153
As soon as possible.

59
00:05:15,713 --> 00:05:16,813
Something came up.

60
00:05:19,653 --> 00:05:20,653
Yes.

61
00:05:20,713 --> 00:05:22,713
Just let me know when the paperwork is ready.

62
00:05:25,113 --> 00:05:26,313
Thanks.

63
00:05:48,453 --> 00:05:51,083
Yes, I'm all done now. I'll wash up and head in.

64
00:05:52,153 --> 00:05:53,153
Yes.

65
00:05:54,913 --> 00:05:55,913
Honey.

66
00:05:56,813 --> 00:06:00,053
But I'm suddenly craving something spicy.

67
00:06:01,853 --> 00:06:03,213
Yes, really spicy.

68
00:06:04,183 --> 00:06:05,183
Okay.

69
00:06:18,613 --> 00:06:19,953
Oh, you're here, Chairman.

70
00:06:19,953 --> 00:06:21,253
Hi, go on.

71
00:06:33,913 --> 00:06:35,613
You call that a workout?

72
00:06:35,683 --> 00:06:36,683
Excuse me?

73
00:06:37,653 --> 00:06:39,083
Well, I already finished running...

74
00:06:48,453 --> 00:06:49,853
Right. Good.

75
00:07:09,653 --> 00:07:10,953
Sorry.

76
00:07:15,983 --> 00:07:17,053
Excuse me.

77
00:07:17,183 --> 00:07:18,813
I'm looking for Gyeol. Han Gyeol.

78
00:07:18,883 --> 00:07:20,213
He's in the first grade.

79
00:07:20,583 --> 00:07:21,683
Mom.

80
00:07:22,153 --> 00:07:23,253
Gyeol.

81
00:07:24,413 --> 00:07:25,613
Let me see.

82
00:07:27,483 --> 00:07:30,053
Are you okay? Are you hurt? I heard there was an accident.

83
00:07:30,113 --> 00:07:33,013
No. I'm okay. I'm perfectly fine.

84
00:07:34,713 --> 00:07:36,013
Mom.

85
00:07:39,153 --> 00:07:41,013
I'm just relieved.

86
00:07:41,383 --> 00:07:44,083
I guess I was just so worried that you were hurt.

87
00:07:44,483 --> 00:07:46,013
As long as you're okay, that's all that matters.

88
00:07:46,613 --> 00:07:51,383
- But Jo Heung Sik is hurt badly. - Who?

89
00:07:51,453 --> 00:07:55,053
Jo Heung Sik. He got hurt because of me...

90
00:07:55,283 --> 00:07:58,053
while he was protecting me.

91
00:08:04,183 --> 00:08:05,283
Gyu Rim.

92
00:08:10,953 --> 00:08:12,483
Hey, I'm fine.

93
00:08:12,613 --> 00:08:14,953
It looks worse than it is. I'm not that hurt.

94
00:08:15,283 --> 00:08:17,513
They said it's just a small fracture.

95
00:08:17,583 --> 00:08:20,883
It's not just a small fracture.

96
00:08:20,983 --> 00:08:23,283
If you strain it even a little,

97
00:08:23,753 --> 00:08:26,453
it could snap completely.

98
00:08:29,653 --> 00:08:32,453
I'm telling you, it's nothing to worry about.

99
00:08:32,483 --> 00:08:36,053
- It's really nothing. - It most certainly is.

100
00:08:36,123 --> 00:08:38,513
Frankly, if you break it or get injured,

101
00:08:38,583 --> 00:08:41,183
at your age, it won't heal like it used to.

102
00:08:41,553 --> 00:08:43,983
So it wouldn't hurt to be careful, would it?

103
00:08:47,953 --> 00:08:51,623
That nurse is being a little dramatic.

104
00:08:51,753 --> 00:08:53,653
Just making people worry for no reason.

105
00:08:53,753 --> 00:08:55,183
This doesn't hurt at all...

106
00:08:56,013 --> 00:08:58,783
It doesn't hurt. See?

107
00:08:59,253 --> 00:09:01,123
I'm fine. See?

108
00:09:01,853 --> 00:09:03,683
How did this happen?

109
00:09:04,083 --> 00:09:07,683
Well, I was just passing by, and Gyeol was there...

110
00:09:08,583 --> 00:09:10,513
And one thing just led to another.

111
00:09:10,583 --> 00:09:13,783
How is my mom supposed to understand that?

112
00:09:14,283 --> 00:09:18,483
I was waiting for Ji Woong in front of the donut shop,

113
00:09:19,153 --> 00:09:23,983
and the donut shop's sign fell. I almost got hurt,

114
00:09:24,183 --> 00:09:26,813
but he jumped in and saved me.

115
00:09:29,683 --> 00:09:30,913
Heung Sik.

116
00:09:32,153 --> 00:09:34,583
I'm sorry, Jo Heung Sik.

117
00:09:34,853 --> 00:09:38,453
Thanks to you, I didn't get hurt at all.

118
00:09:38,883 --> 00:09:42,813
I'm telling you it's okay...

119
00:09:43,983 --> 00:09:46,213
I don't know what to say, Heung Sik.

120
00:09:47,183 --> 00:09:50,653
I'm so, so sorry and so, so grateful.

121
00:09:51,123 --> 00:09:53,313
How can I ever repay you for this?

122
00:09:55,513 --> 00:09:58,453
Oh my, what a sight.

123
00:09:59,753 --> 00:10:01,353
What am I going to do with you?

124
00:10:01,553 --> 00:10:03,813
You already get called a Rice Thief...

125
00:10:03,883 --> 00:10:06,283
and every other name in the book.

126
00:10:06,383 --> 00:10:09,813
What is this disgraceful sight?

127
00:10:10,353 --> 00:10:11,683
Oh dear, are you okay?

128
00:10:13,153 --> 00:10:14,453
Ma'am.

129
00:10:15,013 --> 00:10:16,913
Mrs. Park Su Nam.

130
00:10:17,383 --> 00:10:19,853
Hey, why are you two here?

131
00:10:20,383 --> 00:10:23,083
Gyeol, didn't you go to school?

132
00:10:23,683 --> 00:10:24,683
Oh, dear.

133
00:10:25,013 --> 00:10:29,483
Heung Sik got hurt because of Gyeol.

134
00:10:29,653 --> 00:10:30,653
What?

135
00:10:31,453 --> 00:10:35,813
- What did Gyeol do? - A sign fell.

136
00:10:35,883 --> 00:10:40,623
I almost got hurt, but he saved me.

137
00:10:41,123 --> 00:10:42,653
I'm so sorry.

138
00:10:43,653 --> 00:10:44,783
So,

139
00:10:45,283 --> 00:10:47,883
Gyeol was about to get hurt,

140
00:10:48,383 --> 00:10:53,153
and my Heung Sik shielded him, so he ended up like this.

141
00:10:54,113 --> 00:10:55,753
Is that what you're saying?

142
00:10:56,083 --> 00:10:58,883
I'm so sorry. I truly am.

143
00:11:05,813 --> 00:11:06,813
Mom.

144
00:11:07,753 --> 00:11:10,513
He did a good thing. Of course.

145
00:11:11,413 --> 00:11:13,683
He did what he had to do.

146
00:11:15,853 --> 00:11:18,053
I asked the doctor,

147
00:11:18,353 --> 00:11:20,483
and it's not like he broke a bone or anything.

148
00:11:20,553 --> 00:11:22,453
It's a small fracture.

149
00:11:23,283 --> 00:11:26,183
Heung Sik, you're not getting any younger.

150
00:11:26,253 --> 00:11:29,753
Your bones don't just snap back into place like they used to.

151
00:11:29,813 --> 00:11:32,883
It's going to take some time to heal.

152
00:11:33,083 --> 00:11:35,883
- But still, you did well. - It hurts...

153
00:11:35,953 --> 00:11:37,153
Oh, dear.

154
00:11:37,253 --> 00:11:38,483
Ma'am.

155
00:11:40,353 --> 00:11:42,513
You know...

156
00:11:43,153 --> 00:11:45,183
It's not exactly a pretty sight...

157
00:11:45,313 --> 00:11:48,053
when your son, who's almost 40,

158
00:11:48,113 --> 00:11:50,383
is all wrapped up in bandages like this.

159
00:11:51,453 --> 00:11:54,253
But compared to an eight-year-old boy being hurt,

160
00:11:54,283 --> 00:11:56,883
it's a hundred times better. Don't you think?

161
00:11:58,653 --> 00:12:00,013
Oh, dear.

162
00:12:01,883 --> 00:12:06,213
What is all this? I may be laughing, but I'm crying inside, you brat.

163
00:12:06,283 --> 00:12:08,413
- I'm okay. - Oh, dear.

164
00:12:10,483 --> 00:12:14,453
Goodness, for a young man, you have no stamina at all.

165
00:12:14,813 --> 00:12:15,813
Here.

166
00:12:16,513 --> 00:12:18,713
Go wash up. Let's get something to eat.

167
00:12:19,713 --> 00:12:20,713
Eat?

168
00:12:20,813 --> 00:12:22,353
Yes. Let's eat. It's been a while.

169
00:12:22,783 --> 00:12:24,083
I'm not hungry right now.

170
00:12:24,153 --> 00:12:25,813
Hey, eating isn't something you have to be in the mood for.

171
00:12:25,883 --> 00:12:26,883
You just eat when it's mealtime.

172
00:12:27,213 --> 00:12:28,813
Let's just eat together for once.

173
00:12:30,013 --> 00:12:31,213
Okay.

174
00:12:31,453 --> 00:12:32,553
Hey.

175
00:12:32,783 --> 00:12:34,913
You still can't handle spicy food?

176
00:12:35,813 --> 00:12:38,113
Oh, never mind. Hurry up and get out here.

177
00:12:41,183 --> 00:12:42,183
Okay.

178
00:12:52,253 --> 00:12:53,283
Han Gyu Rim.

179
00:12:53,353 --> 00:12:55,413
The woman with Mu Jin. Her name is Han Gyu Rim.

180
00:12:56,653 --> 00:12:58,053
I think she's my age.

181
00:13:01,383 --> 00:13:04,553
She can't hold a candle to Seo Hyun.

182
00:13:05,483 --> 00:13:06,713
Of all the people to date,

183
00:13:06,783 --> 00:13:08,553
how could he choose someone so beneath him?

184
00:13:08,683 --> 00:13:10,813
He must be out of his mind.

185
00:13:13,713 --> 00:13:15,383
She comes from a dirt-poor family.

186
00:13:15,383 --> 00:13:18,513
She has a single father and a bunch of younger siblings.

187
00:13:18,653 --> 00:13:20,183
And on top of that, she only has a high school diploma.

188
00:13:20,453 --> 00:13:22,413
Who knows what she was doing,

189
00:13:22,483 --> 00:13:25,253
but she couldn't even get into a college that anyone can get into.

190
00:13:35,683 --> 00:13:36,683
Oh, my.

191
00:13:42,783 --> 00:13:44,983
Honey, I'm home.

192
00:13:45,383 --> 00:13:46,383
Oh, yes.

193
00:13:50,253 --> 00:13:51,683
Hey, lighten up a bit.

194
00:13:51,883 --> 00:13:53,113
You look like you're not supposed to be here.

195
00:13:53,513 --> 00:13:54,553
Yes.

196
00:13:54,553 --> 00:13:55,553
Honey.

197
00:13:56,983 --> 00:13:59,453
The guest you were bringing was Mu Jin?

198
00:13:59,783 --> 00:14:02,113
- Yes. - You've been well, I trust?

199
00:14:03,253 --> 00:14:05,653
Oh, yes. It's been a long time.

200
00:14:06,283 --> 00:14:07,383
Where's Seo Hyun?

201
00:14:09,013 --> 00:14:10,483
She worked all night and just fell asleep.

202
00:14:10,553 --> 00:14:13,483
- She asked not to be woken up. - Oh, is that so? How convenient.

203
00:14:14,213 --> 00:14:15,713
It smells amazing.

204
00:14:15,783 --> 00:14:17,813
I can smell something delicious from all the way over here.

205
00:14:18,183 --> 00:14:20,213
All right, shall we eat?

206
00:14:25,553 --> 00:14:28,183
Did my husband have to drag you here?

207
00:14:29,213 --> 00:14:30,613
Oh, no, not at all.

208
00:14:33,213 --> 00:14:35,683
Well, since you're here, you should eat before you go.

209
00:14:35,853 --> 00:14:37,083
It's not much, though.

210
00:14:37,613 --> 00:14:38,613
Yes.

211
00:14:44,213 --> 00:14:45,383
It's spicy.

212
00:14:50,353 --> 00:14:52,983
- What are you doing? - Where's Mu Jin?

213
00:14:54,213 --> 00:14:56,113
- He went to wash his hands. - Oh, really?

214
00:14:56,113 --> 00:14:58,983
- Oh, honey. - What?

215
00:14:58,983 --> 00:15:01,153
You're just dumping in chilli powder and peppers like that.

216
00:15:01,213 --> 00:15:03,783
Oh my gosh. How can anyone eat this? It's so spicy.

217
00:15:03,853 --> 00:15:05,853
It smells spicy.

218
00:15:06,183 --> 00:15:09,053
Honey, but do we have anything other than Cheongyang peppers?

219
00:15:09,283 --> 00:15:11,713
Don't we have any Thai chillies?

220
00:15:12,053 --> 00:15:14,853
Can't Mu Jin handle spicy food?

221
00:15:15,153 --> 00:15:16,553
What do you mean he can't handle it?

222
00:15:16,613 --> 00:15:18,853
He should just be grateful and eat what he's given.

223
00:15:19,113 --> 00:15:20,153
He'd better eat it.

224
00:15:20,253 --> 00:15:22,753
Or I'll pry his mouth open and shove it in.

225
00:15:23,153 --> 00:15:24,153
Honey.

226
00:15:24,753 --> 00:15:26,753
I'm doing this because he infuriates me. All right?

227
00:15:27,883 --> 00:15:29,683
I won't be satisfied...

228
00:15:29,983 --> 00:15:30,983
until I see him crying with a runny nose...

229
00:15:31,053 --> 00:15:32,513
after he eats this.

230
00:15:32,583 --> 00:15:33,683
Good grief.

231
00:15:34,253 --> 00:15:36,783
Did you bring Mu Jin here just to give him a hard time?

232
00:15:37,283 --> 00:15:41,113
- Oh my gosh. You must be crazy. - Why?

233
00:15:41,183 --> 00:15:42,183
- How can you add so many peppers? - No.

234
00:15:42,253 --> 00:15:44,113
- No, don't take them out. - Honey, please.

235
00:15:44,113 --> 00:15:45,783
I said it's fine, so don't take them out. It's fine.

236
00:15:45,853 --> 00:15:47,983
- This isn't right. - No, no, it's not.

237
00:15:49,083 --> 00:15:50,913
When I think of all the tears our Seo Hyun shed because of him,

238
00:15:50,913 --> 00:15:54,483
this is nothing. You hear me? Besides, it's not that spicy. Right?

239
00:15:56,453 --> 00:15:57,813
It's fine. No. Don't take them out.

240
00:15:58,253 --> 00:15:59,613
- Don't take them out. - Seriously.

241
00:16:00,283 --> 00:16:01,353
Don't take them out. It's fine.

242
00:16:04,383 --> 00:16:05,453
It's fine.

243
00:16:06,213 --> 00:16:09,053
Hey, don't let the colour fool you. It's not that spicy.

244
00:16:09,613 --> 00:16:11,083
It just has a little kick to it.

245
00:16:11,983 --> 00:16:13,383
And hey, to make it in the professional world,

246
00:16:13,453 --> 00:16:16,213
you can't be a picky eater. You have to eat what you're served.

247
00:16:16,313 --> 00:16:17,313
You're a chef, aren't you?

248
00:16:17,853 --> 00:16:19,113
- Yes, sir. - Right.

249
00:16:19,183 --> 00:16:20,413
Mu Jin, don't eat this.

250
00:16:20,713 --> 00:16:21,713
There are plenty of other side dishes,

251
00:16:21,783 --> 00:16:22,783
so have some of those.

252
00:16:22,853 --> 00:16:25,713
- Oh, why are you like this? - Honey.

253
00:16:25,783 --> 00:16:28,153
Hey, eat. Show some respect for the effort.

254
00:16:28,183 --> 00:16:30,753
Seriously, what is wrong with you?

255
00:16:31,283 --> 00:16:32,553
What did I do?

256
00:16:33,113 --> 00:16:35,853
- Looks good. Thanks for the meal. - Good.

257
00:16:35,853 --> 00:16:36,913
Yes.

258
00:16:46,413 --> 00:16:48,213
- Thank you for the meal. - Go on, eat.

259
00:16:55,453 --> 00:16:59,583
- I'll get you some milk. - Milk? He's not a child.

260
00:16:59,653 --> 00:17:01,083
Mu Jin, right? You don't need any milk, do you?

261
00:17:01,153 --> 00:17:02,383
- I don't need any milk. - See?

262
00:17:02,453 --> 00:17:05,713
- Yes, I can handle it. - See? It's fine. Go ahead and eat.

263
00:17:15,753 --> 00:17:18,783
- It's delicious. - Good. Eat up.

264
00:17:21,413 --> 00:17:23,483
It's spicy, isn't it? So spicy it's killing you, right?

265
00:17:27,353 --> 00:17:28,353
Hey.

266
00:17:28,783 --> 00:17:32,413
This is your punishment. You get that, right?

267
00:17:33,683 --> 00:17:35,883
Yes, sir. I do.

268
00:17:37,113 --> 00:17:38,153
Good, as long as you know.

269
00:17:38,253 --> 00:17:40,553
Then finish everything on this plate. Okay?

270
00:17:41,283 --> 00:17:43,883
Got it? If it were up to me,

271
00:17:44,353 --> 00:17:45,713
I'd make you eat a truckload of this.

272
00:17:46,553 --> 00:17:48,183
When I think of Seo Hyun's tears and how much she suffered,

273
00:17:48,683 --> 00:17:50,783
this doesn't even begin to make up for it.

274
00:17:50,883 --> 00:17:51,883
Eat all of it.

275
00:17:52,683 --> 00:17:55,683
Honey, what has gotten into you?

276
00:17:56,213 --> 00:17:57,213
I'm sorry.

277
00:18:08,053 --> 00:18:10,713
Stop eating that and drink this right now.

278
00:18:10,783 --> 00:18:12,613
No, I'm fine.

279
00:18:13,283 --> 00:18:14,713
Stop being so stubborn...

280
00:18:16,353 --> 00:18:17,353
Seriously...

281
00:18:22,683 --> 00:18:24,913
- Hi, when did you get here? - Oh my...

282
00:18:25,083 --> 00:18:26,083
- Hi. - Seo Hyun.

283
00:18:26,153 --> 00:18:27,153
You're awake?

284
00:18:27,613 --> 00:18:28,783
What are you eating?

285
00:18:30,183 --> 00:18:31,353
Why are you eating something so spicy?

286
00:18:31,453 --> 00:18:32,653
You can't handle spicy food at all.

287
00:18:36,783 --> 00:18:37,783
I'm fine.

288
00:18:38,583 --> 00:18:39,683
It's delicious.

289
00:18:40,083 --> 00:18:41,653
Seo Hyun, leave him alone.

290
00:18:42,383 --> 00:18:44,013
He's getting punished by me right now.

291
00:18:44,213 --> 00:18:45,253
Dad.

292
00:18:46,253 --> 00:18:47,683
Don't eat it. Stop eating.

293
00:18:47,783 --> 00:18:50,553
No, I'm fine. It's bearable.

294
00:18:55,823 --> 00:18:58,353
It looks so spicy. Stop eating it.

295
00:18:58,413 --> 00:19:00,113
- Give that to me. - No. Don't eat it.

296
00:19:00,183 --> 00:19:01,383
Give it back. Seo Hyun, give it back.

297
00:19:01,853 --> 00:19:03,553
Mom, why didn't you do something to stop him?

298
00:19:04,183 --> 00:19:05,183
Seo Hyun.

299
00:19:08,113 --> 00:19:09,183
Seo Hyun, hurry.

300
00:19:12,913 --> 00:19:15,653
No. The squid. Seo Hyun, you're allergic to squid.

301
00:19:15,713 --> 00:19:17,853
- Seo Hyun, spit it out. - Seo Hyun.

302
00:19:17,953 --> 00:19:20,013
- Don't eat it. Spit it out quickly. - Oh, no. Are you okay?

303
00:19:20,083 --> 00:19:21,113
Hey, Seo Hyun.

304
00:19:21,183 --> 00:19:22,183
- Seo Hyun. - Seo Hyun.

305
00:19:22,683 --> 00:19:24,453
- Spit it out, quickly. - Hey, wait.

306
00:19:24,553 --> 00:19:26,483
- Seo Hyun. - I'll call 911.

307
00:19:26,553 --> 00:19:27,583
- Breathe. - Just a second.

308
00:19:27,653 --> 00:19:29,113
- Spit it out. - Wait. I'll call 911.

309
00:19:29,183 --> 00:19:31,283
- Seo Hyun, breathe. - Honey, what are we going to do?

310
00:19:31,353 --> 00:19:33,683
- My phone, where is it? Seo Hyun. - Seo Hyun, breathe.

311
00:19:34,013 --> 00:19:36,453
We're almost at the hospital. You'll be fine.

312
00:19:38,213 --> 00:19:39,553
Oh, what are we going to do, honey?

313
00:19:45,213 --> 00:19:46,983
Are you sure you're okay to be discharged?

314
00:19:47,413 --> 00:19:49,013
You should've stayed for at least a few days.

315
00:19:49,483 --> 00:19:50,513
Hey, why would I need to be...

316
00:19:50,583 --> 00:19:51,653
hospitalized for something this minor?

317
00:19:51,783 --> 00:19:54,013
The hospital even said I was fine and could go home.

318
00:19:59,613 --> 00:20:00,783
What is this? What the...

319
00:20:01,513 --> 00:20:02,553
Did something get in my eye?

320
00:20:03,353 --> 00:20:04,413
Are you okay?

321
00:20:09,153 --> 00:20:10,183
Darn...

322
00:20:10,513 --> 00:20:11,513
Let me see.

323
00:20:12,583 --> 00:20:13,583
Let me see.

324
00:20:28,953 --> 00:20:29,953
Is it better now?

325
00:20:34,113 --> 00:20:35,113
Heung Sik.

326
00:20:35,683 --> 00:20:36,713
Breathe.

327
00:20:40,383 --> 00:20:41,383
I'm okay now.

328
00:20:43,213 --> 00:20:45,613
If anything's bothering you, just tell me. Anything at all.

329
00:20:45,783 --> 00:20:47,083
Nothing's bothering me.

330
00:20:49,853 --> 00:20:52,183
Your mom left for Jindo a little while ago.

331
00:20:52,253 --> 00:20:54,283
She said it looks like her friend is about to pass away.

332
00:20:54,683 --> 00:20:55,783
Is that right?

333
00:20:55,983 --> 00:20:58,283
I heard Ms. Bok Dal didn't have much time left.

334
00:20:59,053 --> 00:21:00,953
She asked me to look after you.

335
00:21:01,613 --> 00:21:03,583
She said, "Gyu Rim, I'm counting on you...

336
00:21:03,913 --> 00:21:05,583
to take good care of Heung Sik."

337
00:21:05,823 --> 00:21:08,113
What's with her? Am I a child?

338
00:21:09,013 --> 00:21:11,383
So I told her I would take full responsibility for you,

339
00:21:11,453 --> 00:21:12,953
and that she shouldn't worry.

340
00:21:13,983 --> 00:21:15,553
Hey, you shouldn't be telling her...

341
00:21:15,613 --> 00:21:17,323
you'll take responsibility. All right?

342
00:21:17,653 --> 00:21:19,183
She's been getting more meddlesome lately,

343
00:21:19,253 --> 00:21:21,213
so what will you do if she tells you to take care of me for good?

344
00:21:22,883 --> 00:21:24,153
Then I will.

345
00:21:25,153 --> 00:21:27,713
Don't even joke about that.

346
00:21:28,713 --> 00:21:29,753
Does it look like I'm joking?

347
00:21:32,283 --> 00:21:33,283
It's a joke, right?

348
00:21:36,053 --> 00:21:37,083
I'm not joking.

349
00:21:38,913 --> 00:21:41,213
Are you out of your mind right now?

350
00:21:41,413 --> 00:21:42,913
You can't just get all emotional because I saved Gyeol...

351
00:21:42,983 --> 00:21:44,453
and start saying things you don't mean.

352
00:21:44,513 --> 00:21:45,713
Snap out of it.

353
00:21:46,913 --> 00:21:47,913
Unbelievable.

354
00:22:03,083 --> 00:22:04,113
Chairman.

355
00:22:07,853 --> 00:22:08,853
What is it?

356
00:22:10,183 --> 00:22:11,453
You weren't answering your phone.

357
00:22:12,583 --> 00:22:13,683
Mrs. Go is looking for you.

358
00:22:17,613 --> 00:22:20,053
I almost drove my own daughter to her death, didn't I?

359
00:22:22,383 --> 00:22:25,713
She's out of danger, and they said we can rest easy now,

360
00:22:26,453 --> 00:22:27,613
so please don't worry too much.

361
00:22:29,053 --> 00:22:32,083
How could a father be so clueless about his own daughter?

362
00:22:34,983 --> 00:22:37,213
I knew Seo Hyun had feelings for you, but...

363
00:22:39,153 --> 00:22:41,483
I never imagined she would go this far.

364
00:22:48,253 --> 00:22:49,253
I'm sorry.

365
00:22:51,483 --> 00:22:53,213
I don't even know why I'm acting this way.

366
00:22:55,953 --> 00:22:57,813
You're completely unfazed,

367
00:22:58,153 --> 00:22:59,713
while Seo Hyun is suffering all by herself.

368
00:22:59,783 --> 00:23:01,283
Then she says she's leaving the country,

369
00:23:01,353 --> 00:23:02,453
and it just makes me so angry.

370
00:23:04,783 --> 00:23:05,783
No.

371
00:23:06,683 --> 00:23:07,753
I'm the one who should be sorry.

372
00:23:08,353 --> 00:23:09,383
And I'm ashamed.

373
00:23:13,713 --> 00:23:14,713
If I were in your shoes, Chairman,

374
00:23:14,713 --> 00:23:15,913
I wouldn't have let me off this easy.

375
00:23:18,883 --> 00:23:21,283
If some guy who's nothing special hurts my precious daughter...

376
00:23:21,383 --> 00:23:22,753
and puts her through so much pain...

377
00:23:24,113 --> 00:23:26,213
If it were me, I would've beaten him half to death.

378
00:23:36,583 --> 00:23:37,683
I'm sorry, Chairman.

379
00:23:39,113 --> 00:23:40,513
You have nothing to be sorry for.

380
00:23:42,583 --> 00:23:43,583
I'm sorry.

381
00:23:48,983 --> 00:23:50,753
Hey, has Seo Hyun's mother calmed down?

382
00:23:52,653 --> 00:23:54,713
Yes, she seems to be doing much better than before.

383
00:23:56,513 --> 00:23:59,983
Gosh, I feel like I really messed things up.

384
00:24:07,053 --> 00:24:09,913
Sir, please try not to get so worked up.

385
00:24:10,053 --> 00:24:11,813
How can I not be worked up?

386
00:24:12,613 --> 00:24:14,353
What did you tell me during the consultation?

387
00:24:14,853 --> 00:24:17,483
What did you say during my consultation?

388
00:24:17,583 --> 00:24:20,653
Didn't you say this skin peel would make my face completely flawless?

389
00:24:21,813 --> 00:24:24,413
Sir, you're the one who said "completely flawless."

390
00:24:25,053 --> 00:24:27,683
If you keep drinking and smoking every day,

391
00:24:27,753 --> 00:24:30,583
go surfing overseas, and neglect your aftercare...

392
00:24:30,653 --> 00:24:34,353
Quiet. Apologise and give me a refund right now.

393
00:24:34,413 --> 00:24:36,153
You darn con artist.

394
00:24:38,183 --> 00:24:42,313
Did you just call me a darn con artist?

395
00:24:43,683 --> 00:24:46,753
Sir, have you been drinking?

396
00:24:47,113 --> 00:24:48,113
What?

397
00:24:48,983 --> 00:24:51,713
I'm not a con artist. I'm a doctor.

398
00:24:52,713 --> 00:24:54,653
You should apologise while I'm still being nice, sir.

399
00:24:55,653 --> 00:24:58,353
Hey, do you have any idea who my parents are?

400
00:24:59,183 --> 00:25:01,783
Did the clinic director not tell you?

401
00:25:03,113 --> 00:25:05,183
With just one word from my parents,

402
00:25:05,583 --> 00:25:08,753
someone like you would be fired on the spot.

403
00:25:08,783 --> 00:25:09,853
Got it?

404
00:25:10,783 --> 00:25:13,083
All right, I've had just about enough of this.

405
00:25:13,753 --> 00:25:16,753
You squashed citrus peel-looking jerk.

406
00:25:17,483 --> 00:25:20,583
Hey. If you want an apology so badly,

407
00:25:21,013 --> 00:25:24,213
ask your mom and dad who gave you that bad skin.

408
00:25:24,283 --> 00:25:27,613
If you want flawless skin, you'll have to be born again, you brat.

409
00:25:28,153 --> 00:25:30,353
Your mom gave birth to a son like you...

410
00:25:30,413 --> 00:25:31,453
and actually celebrated?

411
00:25:31,513 --> 00:25:33,613
Did she eat abalone shells or something ugly?

412
00:25:34,513 --> 00:25:36,213
(Doctor Han Gyu Young)

413
00:25:36,283 --> 00:25:37,583
(Membership Certificate)

414
00:25:55,283 --> 00:25:56,783
(Han Gyu Oh)

415
00:25:57,183 --> 00:25:58,513
Darn it.

416
00:26:07,783 --> 00:26:09,553
Why do you keep calling?

417
00:26:09,613 --> 00:26:11,713
If I don't pick up, you should assume I'm busy.

418
00:26:11,853 --> 00:26:14,053
What, are you just going to keep calling until I answer?

419
00:26:14,283 --> 00:26:16,153
Gyu Young, why didn't you keep your promise?

420
00:26:19,913 --> 00:26:21,683
Hey, I don't care how busy you are.

421
00:26:21,853 --> 00:26:23,413
Saying, "I'm sorry. It was my fault."

422
00:26:23,483 --> 00:26:26,353
Did you not even have time for those six words?

423
00:26:27,353 --> 00:26:31,713
You need to go to your sister and give her a proper apology.

424
00:26:31,783 --> 00:26:33,783
Bow your head, and then go home. Got it?

425
00:26:34,483 --> 00:26:36,283
If you don't keep your promise,

426
00:26:36,353 --> 00:26:37,613
I won't be able to keep my mouth shut,

427
00:26:37,683 --> 00:26:38,783
so you'd better take care of it.

428
00:26:38,853 --> 00:26:40,053
Darn...

429
00:26:45,483 --> 00:26:46,553
What the heck?

430
00:26:46,683 --> 00:26:49,313
Did everyone decide to gang up on me today or something?

431
00:26:49,583 --> 00:26:50,683
Darn it.

432
00:26:56,353 --> 00:26:58,483
- She hung up. Put your phone away. - Okay.

433
00:27:00,383 --> 00:27:03,083
Do you have some dirt on Han Gyu Young?

434
00:27:03,613 --> 00:27:04,653
What is it?

435
00:27:05,753 --> 00:27:07,083
Shouldn't you be at your part-time job...

436
00:27:07,153 --> 00:27:08,153
instead of here with me?

437
00:27:08,683 --> 00:27:11,813
It's fine. I took a week off. Just think of me as your servant,

438
00:27:11,883 --> 00:27:13,153
and order me to do whatever you want.

439
00:27:14,883 --> 00:27:17,113
But I feel like I'm being a burden to so many people.

440
00:27:17,653 --> 00:27:19,813
A burden? What are you talking about?

441
00:27:20,053 --> 00:27:21,583
You saved our Gyeol, right?

442
00:27:21,653 --> 00:27:23,353
And because you saved Gyeol, you also saved my big sister, right?

443
00:27:23,413 --> 00:27:24,953
And because you saved her, I...

444
00:27:25,083 --> 00:27:27,283
Anyway, you saved our entire family.

445
00:27:27,553 --> 00:27:29,753
It was nothing, so don't keep making a big deal out of it.

446
00:27:29,813 --> 00:27:31,513
Just go to the kitchen and get me some water.

447
00:27:32,053 --> 00:27:33,053
Okay.

448
00:27:35,083 --> 00:27:36,083
So...

449
00:27:36,153 --> 00:27:38,713
what's the dirt on Han Gyu Young? Can't you share it with me?

450
00:27:40,813 --> 00:27:43,583
- Public urination? - Hurry up and get it.

451
00:27:43,583 --> 00:27:44,983
I'm dying of thirst here.

452
00:27:45,113 --> 00:27:46,483
Tell me when I get back.

453
00:27:46,913 --> 00:27:48,283
Unbelievable...

454
00:27:52,683 --> 00:27:53,753
You really got fired?

455
00:27:55,613 --> 00:27:58,483
They said they gave special instructions...

456
00:27:58,483 --> 00:27:59,983
because he's a congressman's son, but I was never told that.

457
00:28:00,053 --> 00:28:01,083
Good for you.

458
00:28:01,683 --> 00:28:03,783
How could he call a doctor a con artist?

459
00:28:04,153 --> 00:28:06,883
Hey, we may not have money, but we have our pride.

460
00:28:07,613 --> 00:28:09,113
I want power.

461
00:28:09,753 --> 00:28:12,383
I want to be crushed to death by a pile of money.

462
00:28:13,483 --> 00:28:15,413
It's for the best, really.

463
00:28:16,113 --> 00:28:18,753
You were having such a hard time with your job anyway.

464
00:28:21,283 --> 00:28:22,513
Actually,

465
00:28:22,583 --> 00:28:25,083
my team leader at work asked if he could meet you.

466
00:28:27,613 --> 00:28:28,653
Your team leader?

467
00:28:28,853 --> 00:28:32,183
Yeah. Remember what I told you? Thanks to that idea you gave me,

468
00:28:32,253 --> 00:28:33,653
we were able to form a task force.

469
00:28:35,153 --> 00:28:37,213
Since you're already so involved,

470
00:28:37,853 --> 00:28:39,383
you should come and help us out.

471
00:28:55,083 --> 00:28:56,083
Hey.

472
00:28:56,213 --> 00:28:58,283
You're supposed to tell someone before you leave the house.

473
00:28:58,683 --> 00:28:59,713
So as I'm walking out the gate,

474
00:28:59,783 --> 00:29:01,013
I should say, "Gyeol is leaving now."

475
00:29:01,083 --> 00:29:02,483
Is that what you want me to do?

476
00:29:04,983 --> 00:29:05,983
Anyway, where are you going?

477
00:29:06,383 --> 00:29:08,953
Woo Ram's family got a new puppy, so I'm going to see it.

478
00:29:09,513 --> 00:29:11,653
Who's at home? Is your mom back?

479
00:29:11,883 --> 00:29:15,113
No. Only Grandpa is there. I'll be going now.

480
00:29:16,813 --> 00:29:17,813
Hey, Han Gyeol.

481
00:29:20,613 --> 00:29:22,683
Listen up. It's eight words.

482
00:29:23,153 --> 00:29:27,013
I am sorry, and I admit I was wrong. Tell your mom I said that.

483
00:29:27,083 --> 00:29:30,013
And she has to tell Jo Heung Sik that I apologised.

484
00:29:30,213 --> 00:29:32,153
It's a little complicated, right? Want me to explain it again?

485
00:29:32,213 --> 00:29:35,183
- So... - Why make a child do that?

486
00:29:35,183 --> 00:29:36,253
Let go.

487
00:29:39,213 --> 00:29:42,353
If you're going to apologise, shouldn't you do it yourself?

488
00:29:44,013 --> 00:29:46,183
Aren't you guys supposed to be at evening study hall?

489
00:29:46,683 --> 00:29:48,783
No wonder your grades are always terrible.

490
00:29:48,913 --> 00:29:50,053
What does that have to do with you?

491
00:29:50,213 --> 00:29:51,413
Are you back for good?

492
00:29:51,553 --> 00:29:53,283
What do you care whether I am or not?

493
00:29:53,383 --> 00:29:54,713
I'm coming into my own home.

494
00:29:54,783 --> 00:29:56,783
What makes you say this is your house?

495
00:29:57,153 --> 00:29:58,753
Gyeol, go inside.

496
00:29:59,083 --> 00:30:00,783
But I was on my way out.

497
00:30:00,983 --> 00:30:02,813
Okay, then. Go on.

498
00:30:03,183 --> 00:30:04,183
Are you guys going to fight again?

499
00:30:04,483 --> 00:30:05,583
We're not going to fight.

500
00:30:06,383 --> 00:30:08,113
When we got this house,

501
00:30:08,213 --> 00:30:09,813
I pitched in at least 50,000 dollars, you know.

502
00:30:10,283 --> 00:30:11,413
You guys are just mooching off of everyone...

503
00:30:11,483 --> 00:30:12,483
without paying a cent,

504
00:30:12,553 --> 00:30:14,683
but I have at least 50,000 dollars of my own money in this house.

505
00:30:14,753 --> 00:30:15,983
50,000 Dollars, my foot.

506
00:30:16,853 --> 00:30:20,453
- Gyeol's here. Your voice down. - I'm going to Woo Ram's family's.

507
00:30:20,513 --> 00:30:22,283
If you have something to say, just say it, Gyu Min.

508
00:30:22,483 --> 00:30:23,483
I'll be back.

509
00:30:26,913 --> 00:30:30,053
Well, will you look at that. Are you all ganging up on me?

510
00:30:30,853 --> 00:30:33,883
Fine, I'm the wicked stepsister. I'm the bad guy.

511
00:30:34,753 --> 00:30:35,753
I'm sorry.

512
00:30:37,253 --> 00:30:38,353
I'm truly sorry.

513
00:30:40,113 --> 00:30:41,853
Why are you suddenly apologising?

514
00:30:41,913 --> 00:30:43,513
What do you have to be sorry for?

515
00:30:44,413 --> 00:30:45,883
You are really getting on my nerves today.

516
00:30:46,453 --> 00:30:48,053
For my mother having an affair with our father.

517
00:30:49,353 --> 00:30:50,753
And because of that, your mother...

518
00:30:50,813 --> 00:30:52,153
was forced to get a divorce and leave.

519
00:30:53,853 --> 00:30:55,453
And then, not even three years later,

520
00:30:55,513 --> 00:30:57,013
my mother fell for the company accountant...

521
00:30:57,083 --> 00:30:58,513
and they ran off with the family's entire fortune.

522
00:30:58,983 --> 00:31:00,583
I am sorry for bankrupting our family.

523
00:31:00,653 --> 00:31:01,653
Hey.

524
00:31:02,283 --> 00:31:03,753
Why are you apologising for that?

525
00:31:04,283 --> 00:31:05,653
It's all that woman's fault.

526
00:31:05,713 --> 00:31:07,153
If anyone should apologise, it's her.

527
00:31:07,713 --> 00:31:09,153
So why are you the one doing it?

528
00:31:09,953 --> 00:31:11,383
Keep your voice down, Han Gyu Min.

529
00:31:12,683 --> 00:31:13,753
Why are you apologising for something...

530
00:31:13,753 --> 00:31:14,913
that isn't even your fault?

531
00:31:15,683 --> 00:31:16,783
This is so frustrating.

532
00:31:19,083 --> 00:31:22,353
Hey, why don't you say it louder? Go on, make a scene...

533
00:31:22,413 --> 00:31:23,883
so the whole neighbourhood knows our business.

534
00:31:25,053 --> 00:31:26,913
Oh, dear...

535
00:31:29,783 --> 00:31:33,113
Every single one of them is so pathetic.

536
00:31:34,053 --> 00:31:36,813
I have to get married and escape this stupid family...

537
00:31:36,813 --> 00:31:38,013
place as soon as possible.

538
00:31:39,013 --> 00:31:40,353
What are you crying about?

539
00:31:52,253 --> 00:31:54,813
Let's go get some ice cream. My treat.

540
00:31:55,153 --> 00:31:56,553
- Come on, let's go. - No, I don't want to.

541
00:31:56,983 --> 00:31:58,083
Oh, dear.

542
00:32:00,653 --> 00:32:02,113
(Episode 32, 500 Million)

543
00:32:09,653 --> 00:32:10,813
Oh, deities.

544
00:32:11,483 --> 00:32:13,083
Money is the root of all evil.

545
00:32:13,353 --> 00:32:15,053
Please, to this poor little lamb,

546
00:32:15,683 --> 00:32:17,583
grant a shower of money.

547
00:32:17,983 --> 00:32:19,753
I wouldn't mind dying in a downpour of cash,

548
00:32:19,813 --> 00:32:22,283
so please, just one big win.

549
00:32:22,783 --> 00:32:26,353
Just one big win, I beg of you.

550
00:32:27,653 --> 00:32:29,553
Namu Amida Butsu.

551
00:32:29,613 --> 00:32:31,313
Hallelujah.

552
00:32:37,883 --> 00:32:39,653
This place is a minefield.

553
00:32:47,713 --> 00:32:48,713
Father.

554
00:32:50,083 --> 00:32:51,283
Mr. Han Seok Joong?

555
00:32:55,513 --> 00:32:56,653
Can you see me?

556
00:32:58,783 --> 00:33:01,183
You said I died years ago.

557
00:33:02,583 --> 00:33:04,583
Are you telling me you can see ghosts?

558
00:33:05,753 --> 00:33:07,113
So childish.

559
00:33:09,813 --> 00:33:11,583
There's something you need to do, Father.

560
00:33:13,953 --> 00:33:15,553
Do I look like your father?

561
00:33:15,683 --> 00:33:16,753
Oh, come on.

562
00:33:19,883 --> 00:33:22,213
Just you wait until I win this lottery.

563
00:33:22,713 --> 00:33:24,653
I'm not giving you a single cent.

564
00:33:29,483 --> 00:33:31,683
Let's marry off Han Gyu Rim.

565
00:33:33,213 --> 00:33:36,883
- What? - Not saying get married for real.

566
00:33:36,953 --> 00:33:39,253
We're going to start a rumour that Gyeol's Dad is back.

567
00:33:39,583 --> 00:33:41,613
We don't even have to tell the whole town.

568
00:33:41,683 --> 00:33:43,783
We just have to fool Heung Sik and Su Nam.

569
00:33:45,013 --> 00:33:46,583
Who is Gyeol's Dad?

570
00:33:47,783 --> 00:33:48,783
I have no idea.

571
00:33:50,413 --> 00:33:54,583
Come on, did you quit being a doctor to become a con artist instead?

572
00:33:56,283 --> 00:33:57,483
So you're not going to help me?

573
00:33:57,553 --> 00:33:58,883
No, I'm not helping.

574
00:33:59,483 --> 00:34:01,183
If you're going to lie, at least make it believable.

575
00:34:01,953 --> 00:34:04,683
It's the only way Jo Heung Sik will give up and leave her alone.

576
00:34:04,853 --> 00:34:06,253
Then he'll cut ties with Han Gyu Rim...

577
00:34:06,283 --> 00:34:07,313
and my...no...

578
00:34:07,723 --> 00:34:09,983
He'll stop meddling in our family's business too.

579
00:34:10,413 --> 00:34:12,113
You don't like Jo Heung Sik either.

580
00:34:12,653 --> 00:34:13,813
It's a loser.

581
00:34:15,813 --> 00:34:17,683
I've decided to turn over a new leaf and live a good life,

582
00:34:17,753 --> 00:34:18,753
so just leave me alone.

583
00:34:24,153 --> 00:34:25,153
Actually...

584
00:34:26,223 --> 00:34:29,613
I'll tell my future in-laws you're alive again.

585
00:34:31,513 --> 00:34:33,653
What am I, Jesus?

586
00:34:34,453 --> 00:34:36,053
Have I been resurrected?

587
00:34:37,753 --> 00:34:38,883
Please...

588
00:34:40,583 --> 00:34:41,913
come to my wedding.

589
00:34:43,813 --> 00:34:44,813
Gyu Young.

590
00:34:45,853 --> 00:34:47,053
When I think about it,

591
00:34:49,113 --> 00:34:51,353
I think I really need you.

592
00:34:53,813 --> 00:34:55,083
Please help me.

593
00:34:56,583 --> 00:34:57,583
Hey.

594
00:34:58,053 --> 00:35:00,453
Gyu Young, why are you crying?

595
00:35:01,653 --> 00:35:03,413
Hey, why is the invincible Han Gyu Young crying?

596
00:35:04,313 --> 00:35:08,083
Oh, no. You know I have a weakness for tears.

597
00:35:10,083 --> 00:35:12,083
Oh, don't cry.

598
00:35:12,153 --> 00:35:15,513
Oh, my sweet girl. Okay, so what can I do for you?

599
00:35:16,313 --> 00:35:17,313
Your cooperation.

600
00:35:18,413 --> 00:35:20,313
- My cooperation? - Yes.

601
00:35:21,253 --> 00:35:22,313
You'll help me, right?

602
00:35:24,313 --> 00:35:25,353
Right?

603
00:35:25,723 --> 00:35:27,013
I'll have to think about it.

604
00:35:30,013 --> 00:35:34,283
Don't cry.

605
00:35:34,353 --> 00:35:36,083
All right, fine.

606
00:35:37,223 --> 00:35:40,483
- Where's Heung Sik? - I was washing his face. I'm done.

607
00:35:40,753 --> 00:35:41,753
What's all this?

608
00:35:41,813 --> 00:35:44,683
It's for you and Heung Sik. You must be hungry. I'll get dinner ready.

609
00:35:44,753 --> 00:35:46,553
- Here, take this. - Okay.

610
00:35:46,913 --> 00:35:49,313
Heung Sik. I'm here.

611
00:35:50,253 --> 00:35:51,953
What? What are you doing here?

612
00:35:52,413 --> 00:35:53,413
You're dripping water.

613
00:35:53,883 --> 00:35:57,723
Gosh, what a sloppy job Gyu Oh did.

614
00:36:02,223 --> 00:36:04,013
Heung Sik, breathe.

615
00:36:04,283 --> 00:36:05,613
Oh, right.

616
00:36:06,883 --> 00:36:07,883
Gyu Rim.

617
00:36:08,183 --> 00:36:10,613
- Can I step out for a minute? - Where to?

618
00:36:10,783 --> 00:36:12,283
I forgot I have to give something...

619
00:36:12,353 --> 00:36:14,283
to a friend today. I'll only be two hours.

620
00:36:14,353 --> 00:36:15,353
- No way. - Go on.

621
00:36:18,383 --> 00:36:19,913
You can't just leave me alone with your sister,

622
00:36:19,983 --> 00:36:23,383
and go off somewhere for two hours. No way. Absolutely not.

623
00:36:26,723 --> 00:36:27,723
No.

624
00:36:27,813 --> 00:36:29,183
What is this?

625
00:36:32,183 --> 00:36:34,613
Come on, let's eat, Heung Sik.

626
00:36:37,353 --> 00:36:38,353
Hey.

627
00:36:40,183 --> 00:36:42,653
There's a seat over there. Why are you sitting next to me?

628
00:36:42,723 --> 00:36:44,223
To feed you.

629
00:36:45,983 --> 00:36:48,283
- Am I a baby? - You're like a baby now.

630
00:36:48,283 --> 00:36:49,883
You can’t use your hands right now.

631
00:36:51,013 --> 00:36:53,783
Forget it. I'll just eat when Gyu Oh gets back.

632
00:36:54,283 --> 00:36:56,283
How can you wait until Gyu Oh gets here?

633
00:36:56,513 --> 00:36:58,313
I worked so hard to make all this.

634
00:36:59,153 --> 00:37:00,483
The rice and soup will get cold.

635
00:37:02,553 --> 00:37:03,553
All right, fine.

636
00:37:04,753 --> 00:37:05,783
I'll sit here.

637
00:37:10,513 --> 00:37:14,283
Give me the rice. I can eat by myself with this.

638
00:37:14,753 --> 00:37:16,583
I heard you like anchovy wraps,

639
00:37:16,653 --> 00:37:18,483
so I went to the fish market to buy some.

640
00:37:18,753 --> 00:37:19,983
It's going to be so good, right?

641
00:37:21,553 --> 00:37:23,013
Here.

642
00:37:25,613 --> 00:37:27,723
Add the anchovy...

643
00:37:28,313 --> 00:37:31,313
and some rice...

644
00:37:32,223 --> 00:37:33,283
Open your mouth.

645
00:37:34,113 --> 00:37:36,783
Just put it on the table. I'll eat it myself.

646
00:37:37,383 --> 00:37:40,113
Why would I put it on the table? Come on.

647
00:37:40,613 --> 00:37:44,313
I'm not eating a wrap you made. I said just put it on the table.

648
00:37:44,723 --> 00:37:46,813
I washed my hands, you know.

649
00:37:48,883 --> 00:37:51,553
If I eat a wrap you made and have a heart attack,

650
00:37:51,613 --> 00:37:52,683
are you going to take responsibility?

651
00:37:52,883 --> 00:37:55,183
Yes, I'll take responsibility.

652
00:37:57,223 --> 00:37:59,223
You're really driving me crazy.

653
00:37:59,813 --> 00:38:02,113
I told you not to say you'd take responsibility, didn't I?

654
00:38:02,413 --> 00:38:05,153
If my mom heard you say that, she'd make you sign a pledge...

655
00:38:05,223 --> 00:38:07,913
and never let you go. Come on.

656
00:38:12,753 --> 00:38:15,483
You know, I think it's better if I stay by Seo Hyun's side.

657
00:38:15,553 --> 00:38:16,553
Hey, turn the car around.

658
00:38:16,983 --> 00:38:18,153
No, honey.

659
00:38:18,223 --> 00:38:19,783
I'll stay with Seo Hyun.

660
00:38:19,853 --> 00:38:22,153
- Jung Woo, turn the car around. - Should we?

661
00:38:22,223 --> 00:38:25,013
Oh, come on. I just barely got things settled,

662
00:38:25,083 --> 00:38:26,513
and now you two are starting again?

663
00:38:27,183 --> 00:38:29,783
I'm sorry to keep dropping truth bombs,

664
00:38:29,953 --> 00:38:31,053
but when Seo Hyun wakes up,

665
00:38:31,223 --> 00:38:32,353
do you think she'll be happy seeing you two?

666
00:38:32,413 --> 00:38:33,483
Or will she want to see Mu Jin?

667
00:38:34,883 --> 00:38:36,853
Hey, what kind of nonsense is that?

668
00:38:37,183 --> 00:38:39,983
I mean, when she wakes up, her parents should be right there...

669
00:38:39,983 --> 00:38:41,153
so she'll feel safe and reassured.

670
00:38:41,483 --> 00:38:44,223
Why should Mu Jin be there? He's a stranger, that's all.

671
00:38:44,613 --> 00:38:45,983
And not just any stranger,

672
00:38:46,913 --> 00:38:47,953
he's a very bad guy.

673
00:38:48,013 --> 00:38:50,153
You know he's not in his right mind, don't you?

674
00:38:50,223 --> 00:38:51,313
Take what he says with a grain of salt.

675
00:38:53,153 --> 00:38:56,013
What happened today was completely your fault.

676
00:38:56,753 --> 00:38:59,413
You said you made up with Mu Jin, so why are you like this again?

677
00:39:00,223 --> 00:39:03,513
I was fine until a minute ago. I don't know.

678
00:39:04,223 --> 00:39:07,113
Just hearing Mu Jin's name makes me so angry.

679
00:39:07,223 --> 00:39:08,783
Beating him to death wouldn't be enough.

680
00:39:09,483 --> 00:39:11,783
Should I put some poison in his food?

681
00:39:12,223 --> 00:39:13,653
Not you too. What's gotten into you?

682
00:39:15,283 --> 00:39:16,283
Hey.

683
00:39:17,513 --> 00:39:20,383
What if Mu Jin tries to get revenge and tries to hurt Seo Hyun?

684
00:39:20,613 --> 00:39:21,613
Honey.

685
00:39:23,253 --> 00:39:25,013
This is hopeless. Jung Woo, cover your ears.

686
00:39:25,583 --> 00:39:28,283
He gets so childish when it comes to Seo Hyun,

687
00:39:28,353 --> 00:39:29,483
just like a kid.

688
00:39:29,613 --> 00:39:31,683
That's why I'm not planning on having a daughter.

689
00:39:37,813 --> 00:39:41,053
Please give Mu Jin one more chance.

690
00:39:41,913 --> 00:39:44,083
You have to give the guy that much,

691
00:39:44,723 --> 00:39:47,683
so he can reflect more deeply on his past wrongs...

692
00:39:47,983 --> 00:39:49,853
and have time to atone for them.

693
00:40:49,913 --> 00:40:52,013
Yes, I'm making ox knee soup right now.

694
00:40:52,313 --> 00:40:54,313
I'll drop it off on my way to work.

695
00:40:55,113 --> 00:40:56,113
Okay.

696
00:40:56,783 --> 00:40:58,183
Is Heung Sik okay?

697
00:40:58,753 --> 00:40:59,753
He's fine.

698
00:41:00,583 --> 00:41:01,583
Okay.

699
00:41:02,153 --> 00:41:03,483
See you later, Gyu Oh.

700
00:41:04,553 --> 00:41:05,553
See you.

701
00:41:16,223 --> 00:41:18,013
That Rice Thief found me out.

702
00:41:19,513 --> 00:41:22,313
And now he's blackmailing me. If I don't do what he says,

703
00:41:22,383 --> 00:41:24,223
he's threatening to tell Sung Wook everything.

704
00:41:26,483 --> 00:41:27,483
What am I going to do?

705
00:41:28,053 --> 00:41:30,313
What am I going to do if that Rice Thief ruins my wedding?

706
00:41:32,183 --> 00:41:34,183
Did you actually see Heung Sik steal rice?

707
00:41:34,513 --> 00:41:37,153
- What? - Why keep calling him a Rice Thief?

708
00:41:37,553 --> 00:41:39,553
Do you want to get sued for defamation?

709
00:41:40,383 --> 00:41:42,083
Are you taking that Rice Thief's side?

710
00:41:42,153 --> 00:41:43,653
There you go again, calling him a Rice Thief.

711
00:41:45,353 --> 00:41:46,783
Just say that one more time.

712
00:41:47,353 --> 00:41:49,083
Why? What? Are you going to hit me with that?

713
00:41:49,253 --> 00:41:51,253
Are you going to hit me just because I called him a Rice Thief?

714
00:41:53,953 --> 00:41:55,053
Are you crazy?

715
00:41:55,253 --> 00:41:56,653
Just because I called him a Rice Thief...

716
00:41:57,353 --> 00:41:58,913
Darn it.

717
00:41:59,753 --> 00:42:01,783
Don't you talk about Heung Sik like that.

718
00:42:01,853 --> 00:42:03,783
If you call him that one more time,

719
00:42:03,913 --> 00:42:05,883
I'll be the one to go and ruin your wedding.

720
00:42:06,383 --> 00:42:07,583
You and that Rice Thief...

721
00:42:07,653 --> 00:42:09,153
What's going on between you and Jo Heung Sik?

722
00:42:09,223 --> 00:42:11,413
So what if there is? What business is it of yours?

723
00:42:13,183 --> 00:42:14,183
Are you dating?

724
00:42:14,613 --> 00:42:15,753
Yes, we are.

725
00:42:16,853 --> 00:42:17,883
Since when?

726
00:42:18,983 --> 00:42:19,983
Since right now.

727
00:42:20,353 --> 00:42:21,413
What?

728
00:42:21,983 --> 00:42:23,983
Unbelievable.

729
00:42:40,553 --> 00:42:41,553
Are you awake?

730
00:42:47,453 --> 00:42:48,453
Here, lean on this.

731
00:42:50,353 --> 00:42:51,353
One second.

732
00:42:56,083 --> 00:42:57,083
Are you uncomfortable?

733
00:42:57,513 --> 00:42:58,583
Should I get you another pillow?

734
00:43:00,783 --> 00:43:03,283
- Give me some water, please. - Okay.

735
00:43:27,653 --> 00:43:28,683
Why would you do that?

736
00:43:32,353 --> 00:43:34,813
My only thought was that I had to stop you.

737
00:43:35,723 --> 00:43:37,813
I forgot I'm allergic to squid.

738
00:43:38,253 --> 00:43:40,153
That's not something you should forget.

739
00:43:41,183 --> 00:43:42,783
You could have died.

740
00:43:44,083 --> 00:43:45,213
But I didn't.

741
00:43:49,683 --> 00:43:50,883
Don't you ever think about your parents?

742
00:43:52,453 --> 00:43:54,953
Do you know how worried the Chairman and Mrs. Go were?

743
00:43:56,453 --> 00:43:57,953
My dad started it.

744
00:43:58,653 --> 00:44:00,753
He wanted to get back at you,

745
00:44:01,213 --> 00:44:03,383
so he deliberately fed you something spicy.

746
00:44:04,053 --> 00:44:05,053
Hey, you...

747
00:44:06,713 --> 00:44:08,183
Am I the only person you see?

748
00:44:08,953 --> 00:44:10,513
Do your parents not even cross your mind?

749
00:44:11,253 --> 00:44:12,583
Is it all just about Kim Mu Jin?

750
00:44:16,653 --> 00:44:18,483
You must think I'm pathetic, don't you?

751
00:44:20,983 --> 00:44:22,753
I'm not the only one.

752
00:44:23,583 --> 00:44:25,683
People have gone crazy for love...

753
00:44:25,753 --> 00:44:27,683
and betrayed their own country for it.

754
00:44:28,283 --> 00:44:29,283
Seo Hyun.

755
00:44:29,413 --> 00:44:31,153
So instead,

756
00:44:32,383 --> 00:44:34,483
you should hurry up and get together with Han Gyu Rim.

757
00:44:34,713 --> 00:44:36,753
Just hurry up and marry her already.

758
00:44:38,953 --> 00:44:40,953
Besides, I heard she isn't even really married.

759
00:44:43,013 --> 00:44:47,653
Don't give me any room for hope. Don't leave any openings for me.

760
00:44:49,653 --> 00:44:52,053
Just do something about it.

761
00:45:01,653 --> 00:45:03,083
His name is Han Gyeol.

762
00:45:04,253 --> 00:45:06,083
First grade, class two, at Byeolhwa Elementary.

763
00:45:07,083 --> 00:45:09,253
His mother is Han Gyu Rim, a single mother.

764
00:45:10,813 --> 00:45:14,283
He has excellent grades and is very bright.

765
00:45:14,383 --> 00:45:15,953
He's also talented in the arts and sports.

766
00:45:16,153 --> 00:45:17,153
When did you find all that out?

767
00:45:18,113 --> 00:45:19,983
Did you already ask Secretary An?

768
00:45:21,113 --> 00:45:23,513
You find out the rest.

769
00:45:23,583 --> 00:45:27,083
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

770
00:45:32,213 --> 00:45:33,253
So what are you going to do?

771
00:45:33,653 --> 00:45:34,653
What do you mean, "what will I do?"

772
00:45:35,853 --> 00:45:38,983
If he really is Mu Jin's son, what are you going to do?

773
00:45:41,753 --> 00:45:42,983
According to Secretary An's report,

774
00:45:43,383 --> 00:45:45,783
if he's really as smart and promising as they say,

775
00:45:47,513 --> 00:45:49,253
we'll bring him here and raise him properly.

776
00:45:51,113 --> 00:45:53,483
Do you think Han Gyu Rim will give him up that easily?

777
00:45:55,083 --> 00:45:56,353
Whether she gives him up or not...

778
00:45:56,413 --> 00:45:58,183
is not her decision to make.

779
00:45:59,013 --> 00:46:00,313
It's mine.

780
00:46:07,583 --> 00:46:08,883
Are you going to the Knife-cut Noodle Soup place?

781
00:46:09,553 --> 00:46:11,253
I thought you said you weren't going there for a while.

782
00:46:11,583 --> 00:46:13,053
I'll go if I feel like it.

783
00:46:13,883 --> 00:46:15,453
What if you run into him?

784
00:46:15,713 --> 00:46:18,053
That's why I'm going during off-hours.

785
00:46:18,313 --> 00:46:20,213
It's not like he works there.

786
00:46:20,313 --> 00:46:22,053
What are the chances I'll run into him again?

787
00:46:41,413 --> 00:46:42,653
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

788
00:46:43,283 --> 00:46:46,483
Oh no.

789
00:46:47,313 --> 00:46:48,353
Are you hurt?

790
00:46:48,453 --> 00:46:50,913
Does this look all right to you, lady?

791
00:46:51,413 --> 00:46:53,213
Look at my shoes.

792
00:46:53,383 --> 00:46:55,713
- What are you going to do? - I'll pay for them.

793
00:46:55,713 --> 00:46:58,613
- Pay for them? - Honey, what's wrong? Are you hurt?

794
00:46:58,613 --> 00:47:01,413
Honey, it hurts so much I can't walk.

795
00:47:01,413 --> 00:47:02,413
Why? What is it?

796
00:47:02,413 --> 00:47:07,183
This woman stepped on my shoe, and this part broke off.

797
00:47:08,413 --> 00:47:10,313
I said I'd pay for them.

798
00:47:10,713 --> 00:47:13,953
Look, lady. Do you think these are cheap shoes...

799
00:47:14,013 --> 00:47:16,413
you can buy at a market? My boyfriend...

800
00:47:16,483 --> 00:47:18,313
bought these for me on his trip to Italy.

801
00:47:18,483 --> 00:47:21,983
They're not something you can just offer to replace.

802
00:47:22,683 --> 00:47:25,083
I said I'll pay for them. How much are they?

803
00:47:25,253 --> 00:47:28,083
Who do you think you're talking to? Watch your tone.

804
00:47:28,583 --> 00:47:30,383
You started it.

805
00:47:30,453 --> 00:47:31,453
When did I?

806
00:47:31,513 --> 00:47:34,253
Hey, I may look young, but I'm older than you.

807
00:47:34,383 --> 00:47:35,383
Hey, lady.

808
00:47:35,813 --> 00:47:37,013
Watch your mouth.

809
00:47:37,653 --> 00:47:40,753
If you can't afford to pay, you should have just stayed home.

810
00:47:41,053 --> 00:47:43,253
So what if you're older? Is that supposed to be a big deal?

811
00:47:43,753 --> 00:47:45,183
Yes, it is.

812
00:47:46,183 --> 00:47:49,853
- And who are you? - Watching you rude little brats,

813
00:47:49,913 --> 00:47:52,253
I can't even eat my noodles in peace.

814
00:47:52,483 --> 00:47:53,583
I asked, who are you?

815
00:47:53,713 --> 00:47:54,713
I just told you.

816
00:47:54,783 --> 00:47:56,813
I'm the man who was quietly eating noodles in the back.

817
00:47:57,083 --> 00:47:58,083
Hey, just a minute.

818
00:47:59,113 --> 00:48:01,683
How much is it? Hey, give me your account number.

819
00:48:01,753 --> 00:48:03,383
- Give it here. - Oh my goodness.

820
00:48:03,453 --> 00:48:05,983
- This punk. - Oh my, is this guy crazy?

821
00:48:06,313 --> 00:48:07,313
50 dollars.

822
00:48:07,713 --> 00:48:10,283
At most, you just need to send her 50 dollars.

823
00:48:11,213 --> 00:48:13,013
- Should I lend it to you? - Hey, mister.

824
00:48:14,253 --> 00:48:16,983
You're making such a scene over a fake?

825
00:48:17,053 --> 00:48:18,053
Mister.

826
00:48:18,383 --> 00:48:19,553
Hey, you.

827
00:48:20,113 --> 00:48:21,453
This scrawny little punk.

828
00:48:21,883 --> 00:48:25,453
Hey, what would a guy like you know about designer brands?

829
00:48:25,913 --> 00:48:26,913
I do.

830
00:48:26,983 --> 00:48:28,953
I used to make and sell these myself.

831
00:48:29,213 --> 00:48:30,653
I can spot them a mile away.

832
00:48:31,113 --> 00:48:34,983
Should I tell you that bag she's holding it's a fake too?

833
00:48:35,783 --> 00:48:38,953
Honey, what is that man talking about? Is this a fake?

834
00:48:38,953 --> 00:48:41,053
This crazy bastard. Darn it. Hey, will you shut up?

835
00:48:41,113 --> 00:48:42,653
Who are you to butt in?

836
00:48:42,713 --> 00:48:43,983
Stop spouting nonsense about designer brands.

837
00:48:44,053 --> 00:48:47,383
- Hey, you bastard. - Sir, please call the police.

838
00:48:47,613 --> 00:48:49,853
- What are you staring at? - That one's worth about 40 dollars.

839
00:48:49,853 --> 00:48:51,583
- You're ridiculous. Shut up, punk. - Let go.

840
00:48:51,583 --> 00:48:52,983
Stay out of this.

841
00:48:53,053 --> 00:48:56,753
(Danim-Gil Kalguksu)

842
00:49:00,553 --> 00:49:01,553
Are you all right?

843
00:49:03,253 --> 00:49:05,013
So it really was a fake.

844
00:49:06,883 --> 00:49:08,983
Wait, you didn't know it was a fake?

845
00:49:09,153 --> 00:49:10,413
How would I know that?

846
00:49:11,253 --> 00:49:13,413
I just said that to get you out of trouble.

847
00:49:14,113 --> 00:49:15,353
But that guy fell right for it.

848
00:49:17,183 --> 00:49:19,053
You had a tough time dealing with them, two against one.

849
00:49:20,183 --> 00:49:23,013
Well, I'm just glad it all worked out.

850
00:49:26,783 --> 00:49:29,513
It's gotten cold. You should order a new one.

851
00:49:30,483 --> 00:49:31,483
It's all right.

852
00:49:32,383 --> 00:49:34,653
- Should I order one for you? - No, it's okay.

853
00:49:38,553 --> 00:49:39,583
Seriously...

854
00:50:14,413 --> 00:50:18,183
(Kwon Hee Na)

855
00:50:21,183 --> 00:50:22,953
(Kwon Hee Na)

856
00:50:31,683 --> 00:50:35,053
- Kids, did you forget anything? - No.

857
00:50:35,053 --> 00:50:37,583
Let's check one more time before we leave the classroom.

858
00:50:37,883 --> 00:50:41,213
Notebooks, water bottles, and hats.

859
00:50:51,413 --> 00:50:55,783
(Gigolo Punk)

860
00:51:00,653 --> 00:51:01,983
(Gigolo Punk)

861
00:51:19,183 --> 00:51:22,213
If you call me one more time, I'm reporting you to the police.

862
00:51:30,783 --> 00:51:33,583
The person you are calling is unavailable.

863
00:51:33,713 --> 00:51:35,813
Please leave a message after the tone.

864
00:51:36,783 --> 00:51:37,783
Kwon Hee Na.

865
00:51:39,113 --> 00:51:40,113
It's Han Gyu Oh.

866
00:51:41,913 --> 00:51:44,113
Did you know this number was mine? Is that why you're not picking up?

867
00:51:45,553 --> 00:51:46,553
Do you hate me that much?

868
00:51:47,983 --> 00:51:49,053
Even if you do, let's just meet once.

869
00:51:51,653 --> 00:51:52,813
Just one time. Let's just meet.

870
00:51:54,553 --> 00:51:56,713
Kids, when we cross the big street,

871
00:51:56,783 --> 00:51:59,953
- no playing around or shouting. - Okay.

872
00:52:00,083 --> 00:52:02,483
Even if the light is green, look for cars or motorcycles.

873
00:52:02,553 --> 00:52:05,353
- You know to look carefully, right? - Yes.

874
00:52:12,413 --> 00:52:13,883
(Gigolo Punk)

875
00:52:14,913 --> 00:52:17,113
What? Why is this bird leaving me a voicemail?

876
00:52:22,913 --> 00:52:25,913
Oh, sorry, kids. A bird suddenly flew by.

877
00:52:26,853 --> 00:52:28,253
There goes the bird.

878
00:52:28,813 --> 00:52:30,753
What kind of bird is it?

879
00:53:06,383 --> 00:53:07,383
Hi, Gyu Rim.

880
00:53:08,153 --> 00:53:09,183
I'm in front of Gyeol's school.

881
00:53:10,553 --> 00:53:11,683
I just got here.

882
00:53:14,383 --> 00:53:16,553
A friend of Heung Sik's offered to watch him for a bit.

883
00:53:21,853 --> 00:53:23,553
That's my oldest uncle.

884
00:53:24,713 --> 00:53:25,853
Gyeol, is your uncle here?

885
00:53:26,053 --> 00:53:28,083
Yes, I have a dentist appointment today,

886
00:53:28,153 --> 00:53:29,283
but Mrs. Park Su Nam wasn't available,

887
00:53:29,283 --> 00:53:30,813
and my mom is busy.

888
00:53:31,213 --> 00:53:32,883
So my oldest uncle said he'd come instead.

889
00:53:32,883 --> 00:53:35,613
Oh, I see. I should go say hello.

890
00:53:40,413 --> 00:53:42,253
All right, I'll make sure he gets there.

891
00:53:42,553 --> 00:53:43,553
Don't worry.

892
00:53:44,553 --> 00:53:45,583
Okay.

893
00:53:47,183 --> 00:53:48,313
Okay.

894
00:53:50,013 --> 00:53:51,053
Oh, here comes Gyeol.

895
00:53:51,113 --> 00:53:52,153
I have to go.

896
00:53:52,213 --> 00:53:54,153
(SOS Device for Elementary Students)

897
00:53:56,083 --> 00:53:57,153
How does it feel? Are you okay?

898
00:53:57,613 --> 00:53:59,113
No, it stings.

899
00:53:59,953 --> 00:54:00,953
It seems you got something in your eye.

900
00:54:01,013 --> 00:54:02,013
What should we do?

901
00:54:03,353 --> 00:54:05,553
Let's try some eye drops first. Should we go to the nurse's office?

902
00:54:08,983 --> 00:54:11,053
Ma'am, you should take Jin Ju to the nurse's office.

903
00:54:11,113 --> 00:54:12,813
I'll get the other kids across the street.

904
00:54:13,453 --> 00:54:14,453
You'd do that?

905
00:54:14,453 --> 00:54:15,453
Yes.

906
00:54:16,213 --> 00:54:18,253
Look! The light's green.

907
00:54:18,783 --> 00:54:20,113
We're going now, ma'am.

908
00:54:20,253 --> 00:54:22,383
- Let's go, everyone. - Cross safely.

909
00:54:29,583 --> 00:54:31,353
Ma'am, it hurts.

910
00:54:31,883 --> 00:54:33,353
Oh, what do I do?

911
00:54:38,753 --> 00:54:40,083
That's my oldest uncle.

912
00:54:40,853 --> 00:54:42,383
- Hello. - Hello.

913
00:54:42,513 --> 00:54:43,683
Hi.

914
00:54:44,253 --> 00:54:46,953
- Bye. - Bye.

915
00:54:47,983 --> 00:54:49,053
Bye.

916
00:54:49,313 --> 00:54:50,313
Bye.

917
00:54:59,953 --> 00:55:01,083
Was that your teacher?

918
00:55:01,913 --> 00:55:02,913
Yes.

919
00:55:03,283 --> 00:55:05,153
- What's her name? - Why?

920
00:55:05,213 --> 00:55:06,983
She just looked familiar.

921
00:55:07,183 --> 00:55:08,753
What do you mean she looked familiar?

922
00:55:09,913 --> 00:55:11,783
She reminds me of someone I know.

923
00:55:12,013 --> 00:55:14,953
Who is it that you know? Who does she look like?

924
00:55:18,013 --> 00:55:19,883
Sorry, forget I asked.

925
00:55:20,183 --> 00:55:21,953
- Let's go. - Uncle.

926
00:55:23,083 --> 00:55:24,383
My teacher's name...

927
00:55:26,583 --> 00:55:27,953
I'm not going to tell you.

928
00:55:29,283 --> 00:55:33,213
- Why not? - My teacher is just your type.

929
00:55:33,853 --> 00:55:37,953
But I don't want you to like my teacher.

930
00:55:39,883 --> 00:55:40,883
Why?

931
00:55:41,153 --> 00:55:43,913
Because you're my uncle, and she's my teacher.

932
00:55:47,053 --> 00:55:49,653
So you don't want things to get messy. Is that it?

933
00:55:50,753 --> 00:55:52,383
Okay, I get what you're saying.

934
00:55:52,453 --> 00:55:54,383
Don't worry. That's not going to happen.

935
00:55:56,953 --> 00:55:58,483
I already like someone.

936
00:56:00,183 --> 00:56:01,553
Hold my hand. Let's go.

937
00:56:09,013 --> 00:56:11,013
(Suragan Side Dishes)

938
00:56:13,683 --> 00:56:14,683
Dad.

939
00:56:16,083 --> 00:56:17,383
What are you doing here?

940
00:56:18,513 --> 00:56:20,453
Right. This is where you work.

941
00:56:21,713 --> 00:56:23,613
I thought I locked up before I left.

942
00:56:27,783 --> 00:56:29,583
The owner must be back.

943
00:56:30,683 --> 00:56:32,153
Seriously.

944
00:56:34,153 --> 00:56:35,153
Gyu Rim.

945
00:56:35,553 --> 00:56:36,553
Yes?

946
00:56:37,683 --> 00:56:41,653
I want you to meet the most wonderful man.

947
00:56:42,213 --> 00:56:43,383
That's why I'm like this.

948
00:56:44,283 --> 00:56:46,313
Not because someone threatened me.

949
00:56:47,513 --> 00:56:49,553
What do you mean? This is out of nowhere.

950
00:56:50,253 --> 00:56:51,683
Right.

951
00:56:53,983 --> 00:56:55,983
(Suragan Side Dishes)

952
00:57:02,413 --> 00:57:03,813
Did you have a good trip?

953
00:57:04,613 --> 00:57:05,613
Yes.

954
00:57:11,453 --> 00:57:13,483
Did your friend pass away?

955
00:57:14,483 --> 00:57:17,513
She's fine. That's why I was able to come back.

956
00:57:20,253 --> 00:57:22,153
But why are you crying, Ma'am?

957
00:57:25,913 --> 00:57:26,983
My friend...

958
00:57:28,413 --> 00:57:30,953
Even as she was taking her last breaths,

959
00:57:31,853 --> 00:57:34,253
she said at least one of her three sons...

960
00:57:34,613 --> 00:57:37,213
had to get married before she could die.

961
00:57:37,283 --> 00:57:39,453
She was desperately clinging to life.

962
00:57:40,713 --> 00:57:42,153
It hit too close to home.

963
00:57:43,283 --> 00:57:45,613
So on my way back from Jindo,

964
00:57:46,553 --> 00:57:50,053
I was going to grab you and beg you.

965
00:57:50,813 --> 00:57:52,553
That's what I had decided to do.

966
00:57:56,783 --> 00:57:58,253
My Heung Sik...

967
00:57:59,353 --> 00:58:01,913
may not be very educated,

968
00:58:02,553 --> 00:58:05,483
and he might not have any special talents,

969
00:58:06,253 --> 00:58:08,883
but he's kind and steadfast.

970
00:58:09,813 --> 00:58:12,053
More than anything, he cherishes you and Gyeol...

971
00:58:12,113 --> 00:58:14,383
more than anything in the world.

972
00:58:16,353 --> 00:58:18,553
I was going to ask you to give my Heung Sik a chance.

973
00:58:18,813 --> 00:58:20,283
That was my plan.

974
00:58:24,953 --> 00:58:27,213
What did my father say to you, Ma'am?

975
00:58:32,253 --> 00:58:34,013
He told me to step aside.

976
00:58:35,213 --> 00:58:37,113
He said Gyeol's Dad came back.

977
00:58:38,953 --> 00:58:41,683
Since you're going to try to make things work with him,

978
00:58:42,083 --> 00:58:45,253
he told my Heung Sik to step aside.

979
00:58:45,983 --> 00:58:46,983
What?

980
00:58:48,783 --> 00:58:51,783
Then it's only right that we step aside.

981
00:58:53,483 --> 00:58:55,383
Gyeol's Dad is back, so what can we do?

982
00:58:56,583 --> 00:59:00,253
Of course, my Heung Sik has to be the one to step aside.

983
00:59:01,953 --> 00:59:07,213
I don't know why these useless tears keep falling, honestly.

984
00:59:25,783 --> 00:59:27,013
Can we talk for a moment?

985
00:59:48,053 --> 00:59:50,353
I'd like you to stop coming to see Seo Hyun.

986
00:59:53,483 --> 00:59:54,483
Excuse me?

987
00:59:55,983 --> 00:59:57,013
What happened yesterday...

988
00:59:57,813 --> 00:59:59,383
wasn't your fault, Mu Jin.

989
01:00:01,683 --> 01:00:04,683
You don't have to keep coming here out of guilt or a sense of duty.

990
01:00:07,083 --> 01:00:08,383
That's not why I'm coming here.

991
01:00:10,253 --> 01:00:11,253
Then why?

992
01:00:13,953 --> 01:00:17,953
What might be simple kindness and affection from you...

993
01:00:18,683 --> 01:00:22,053
makes Seo Hyun get her hopes up...

994
01:00:22,513 --> 01:00:24,183
every time she sees you.

995
01:00:25,813 --> 01:00:27,513
She gets her hopes up, misunderstands,

996
01:00:27,583 --> 01:00:28,983
and gets disappointed every time.

997
01:00:30,253 --> 01:00:32,613
She just keeps clinging to false hope.

998
01:00:37,313 --> 01:00:38,583
Let's stop this now.

999
01:00:40,413 --> 01:00:42,553
This isn't good for Seo Hyun.

1000
01:00:45,213 --> 01:00:46,913
Let's end it here, Mu Jin.

1001
01:00:48,053 --> 01:00:49,413
I'm asking you, please.

1002
01:01:04,253 --> 01:01:05,783
Don't wait for Mu Jin.

1003
01:01:06,353 --> 01:01:07,483
He's not coming anymore.

1004
01:01:08,913 --> 01:01:09,913
Mom.

1005
01:01:11,613 --> 01:01:12,653
You were the one...

1006
01:01:13,383 --> 01:01:15,783
who decided to emigrate just to forget him.

1007
01:01:19,653 --> 01:01:20,853
Just forget him.

1008
01:01:21,653 --> 01:01:23,483
Mu Jin isn't the one for you.

1009
01:01:35,353 --> 01:01:36,483
Mu Jin.

1010
01:01:37,283 --> 01:01:38,283
Mu Jin.

1011
01:01:39,983 --> 01:01:41,453
Let me take over, Ma'am.

1012
01:01:45,413 --> 01:01:48,053
I won't disappoint Seo Hyun anymore,

1013
01:01:48,683 --> 01:01:49,813
or hurt her,

1014
01:01:50,483 --> 01:01:51,913
or confuse her.

1015
01:01:53,413 --> 01:01:54,513
Mu Jin.

1016
01:01:56,783 --> 01:01:57,953
So...

1017
01:01:58,883 --> 01:02:00,653
let's start dating for real, starting now.

1018
01:02:03,413 --> 01:02:05,853
Are you proposing to me right now?

1019
01:02:09,183 --> 01:02:12,783
Yes. I'm proposing to you right now.

1020
01:02:13,253 --> 01:02:16,253
Are you out of your mind? What's gotten into you?

1021
01:02:16,313 --> 01:02:17,453
Are you drunk?

1022
01:02:18,083 --> 01:02:19,083
You...

1023
01:02:20,053 --> 01:02:21,513
know my whole story.

1024
01:02:22,453 --> 01:02:24,853
You know how pathetic and flawed I am.

1025
01:02:27,053 --> 01:02:28,113
You know everything.

1026
01:02:30,553 --> 01:02:32,383
If you're really okay with someone like me,

1027
01:02:34,253 --> 01:02:35,813
let's try dating for real,

1028
01:02:36,613 --> 01:02:37,613
Heung Sik.

1029
01:02:52,083 --> 01:02:54,313
Not like a brother and sister, but as a man and a woman.

1030
01:02:55,313 --> 01:02:56,713
Let's date for real, Seo Hyun.

1031
01:03:35,983 --> 01:03:37,383
(Love on the Menu)

1032
01:03:37,483 --> 01:03:39,613
This man is my boyfriend.

1033
01:03:40,153 --> 01:03:41,283
I hear they've decided to start dating?

1034
01:03:41,353 --> 01:03:43,883
You ended things well with Han Gyu Rim, right?

1035
01:03:43,953 --> 01:03:48,053
Is it okay if I date Gyu Rim? In case you and Gyu Rim...

1036
01:03:48,113 --> 01:03:49,683
might get back together.

1037
01:03:49,753 --> 01:03:52,553
When were Gyu Rim and I ever a thing?

1038
01:03:52,753 --> 01:03:54,613
Are you waiting for a call or something?

1039
01:03:54,883 --> 01:03:57,653
I left a voicemail, but I think I'm being ignored.

1040
01:03:57,713 --> 01:03:59,283
Gyu Oh, is the girl you're looking for Kwon Hee Na?

1041
01:03:59,353 --> 01:04:00,353
Where is she now?

1042
01:04:00,653 --> 01:04:02,953
Gyu Young, let's get another alligator bag ready.

1043
01:04:03,013 --> 01:04:06,483
By any chance, what's the maximum for a line of credit?

1044
01:04:06,853 --> 01:04:07,853
No.

1045
01:04:08,313 --> 01:04:11,413
Once I'm married, I can pay it back in no time.

1046
01:04:11,513 --> 01:04:13,353
